      "amount": "2 tablespoons"
    },
    {
      "name": "Dijon mustard",
      "amount": "1 tablespoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "salt",
      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "black pepper",
      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, combine the chickpeas, red onion, celery, Kalamata olives, and artichoke hearts.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the lemon juice, Dijon mustard, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Pour the dressing over the chickpea mixture and toss to combine.",
    "Stir in the chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Before serving, give the salad a good stir and adjust the seasoning if needed.",
    "Serve chilled, garnished with additional parsley if desired.",
    "This salad can be made ahead of time and stored in the refrigerator for up to 24 hours."
